  "description": "This dataset comprises EEG recordings from a three-person hyperscanning prisoner's dilemma experiment involving 11 triads (33 participants total). The dataset includes raw EEG data collected during three task conditions: decision-making (pddecision), feedback processing (pdfeedback), and rest periods (pdrest). Behavioral labels are provided through event markers in task events.tsv files, enabling analysis of neural correlates of social decision-making and inter-brain synchronization during interactive economic games. EEG data are stored in EEGLAB .set format.",
